        <mxCell id="v220" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Legend: blue dashed = OKE control traffic · gateway links = bidirectional private network path&lt;br/&gt;Data: replica B initiates TCP/3306 to primary A; transactions flow A → B. After a switchover, those directions reverse.&lt;br/&gt;DNS: namespace-specific forwarding over UDP/TCP 53. Each VCN retains its own existing NAT/service-gateway egress (omitted)." style="fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial;fontColor=#312D2A;text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1380" width="1640" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
